  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia: Enhanced Capacity of Immigration&#x2019;s Fraud Detection Units, Passport Enrolment Centres, Regional Offices and Border Posts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention aims to contribute to enhance the capacity of the Somali Immigration&apos;s Fraud Detection Units, Passport Enrolment Centres, Regional Offices and Border Posts. The intervention will consist of construction, facilitation of relevant equipment and training for immigration officers.</narrative>
  </description>
